  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "Alicia earns \\(\\$20\\) per hour, of which \\(1.45\\%\\) is deducted to pay local taxes. How many cents per hour of Alicia’s wages are used to pay local taxes?",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
      "label": "A",
      "text": "\\(0.0029\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "B",
      "text": "\\(0.029\\)"
